01": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\Sch_{fppf}$", "MATH_0003": "$p : \\mathcal{X} \\to (\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0005": "$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0006": "$1$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0008": "$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0009": "$1$", "MATH_0010": "$2$", "MATH_0011": "$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0012": "$\\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0013": "$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0014": "$(2, 1)$", "MATH_0015": "$2$", "MATH_0016": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0017": "$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0018": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0019": "$U \\in \\Ob((\\Sch/S)_{fppf})$", "MATH_0020": "$$\nj : \\mathcal{X} \\longrightarrow (\\Sch/U)_{fppf}\n$$", "MATH_0021": "$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0022": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0023": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0024": "$\\mathcal{X}, \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0025": "$U, V$", "MATH_0026": "$1$", "MATH_0027": "$\\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0028": "$U \\to V$", "MATH_0029": "$U \\to V$", "MATH_0030": "$S$", "MATH_0031": "$1$", "MATH_0032": "$\\phi : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0033": "$U \\to V$", "MATH_0034": "$2$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{categories-definition-fibred-groupoids}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{categories-definition-categories-fibred-in-groupoids-over-C}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{categories-definition-representable-fibred-category}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{categories-lemma-morphisms-representable-fibred-categories}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent", "STRUCT_0002": "\\medskip", "STRUCT_0003": "\\noindent", "STRUCT_0004": "\\medskip", "STRUCT_0005": "\\noindent", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0002": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it ", "TEXTITOPEN_0002": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 2, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:8ce32afc12ce522680aa3a4d145965f3e246969ced11ce24cdfa2150a94c5956", "source_math_skeleton_hash": "sha256:1afd11df257740dacd36341030d0af88640648d89493ba48bbcb446ce0fe1b80", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:cee166c6e6a8f4827bd9371e32b2effe25dc81f915fc8c46c5eb0300c8ae7c90", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a scheme contained in <MATH_0002>.\nThe basic object of study in this chapter will be a\ncategory fibred in groupoids\n<MATH_0003>, see\nCategories, Definition <REF_0001>.\nWe will often simply say ``let <MATH_0004> be a category fibred\nin groupoids over <MATH_0005>'' to indicate\nthis situation. A <MATH_0006>-morphism <MATH_0007> of categories\nfibred in groupoids over <MATH_0008> will be a <MATH_0009>-morphism\nin the <MATH_0010>-category of categories fibred in groupoids over\n<MATH_0011>, see\nCategories,\nDefinition <REF_0002>.\nIt is simply a functor <MATH_0012> over\n<MATH_0013>.\nWe recall this is really a <MATH_0014>-category and that all <MATH_0015>-fibre products\nexist.\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\nLet <MATH_0016> be a category fibred in groupoids over\n<MATH_0017>. Recall that <MATH_0018>\nis said to be <TEXTITOPEN_0001>representable<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> if there exists a\nscheme <MATH_0019> and an\nequivalence\n<MATH_0020>\nof categories over <MATH_0021>, see\nCategories,\nDefinition <REF_0003>.\nWe will sometimes say that <MATH_0022> is\n<TEXTITOPEN_0002>representable by a scheme<TEXTITCLOSE_0002> to distinguish from the case\nwhere <MATH_0023> is representable by an algebraic space (see\nbelow).\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\nIf <MATH_0024> are fibred in groupoids and\nrepresentable by <MATH_0025>, then we have\n<MATHSEG_0001>-isomorphism<MATHSEG_0002>\nsee\nCategories,\nLemma <REF_0004>.\nMore precisely, any <MATH_0026>-morphism <MATH_0027>\ngives rise to a morphism <MATH_0028>. Conversely, given a morphism\nof schemes <MATH_0029> over <MATH_0030> there exists a <MATH_0031>-morphism\n<MATH_0032> which gives rise to <MATH_0033>\nand which is unique up to unique <MATH_0034>-isomorphism.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:bb7fb2d3802076ea6fa4fa5377b42d6047bf9be0a2b425cd1e0afff61163d7c3", "unit_id": "tag:02ZQ:prose-0001"}
